## Premise
ApplicationSet (gitops/argocd/randomquotes-applicationset-previews.yaml) watches
open PRs matching ^feat/.* — each creates a randomquotes-preview-pr-<N> Application
deploying that PR's branch into argo-randomquotes-preview-pr-<N> namespace.

